WEBVTT

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:03.650
Bye-bye!

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:07.230
Time just flew by, didn't it?

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.730
It feels like you entered our school just yesterday,

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:12.150
but you're becoming a second-year already.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.240
That's right...

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.580
<i>And Run-chan will be a third-year...</i>

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:23.710
Good-bye!

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.210
Yeah!

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.210
Bye-bye!

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.270
Tooru! Are you up yet?

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.060
Yeah.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.440
The semester starts today, right? Don't be late.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:46.270
Got it.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:48.650
See you tonight!

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:40.590
Morning, Nagi.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.220
Yo...

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:49.310
What's wrong, Nagi? You seem out of it.

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:53.560
I got hooked on a novel and was up late reading it.

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:56.320
Ah, so you didn't get enough sleep.

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:58.070
Staying up late is bad for you, you know.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:03.070
Actually, it's because I ate two boxes of chocolate while I was at it.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.160
I'm in the midst of self-loathing.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.500
<i>Fallen to the temptation of sweets!</i>

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:12.040
I-I also ended up reading a book till morning the other day.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.630
It was titled, "On That Night."

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:16.000
Oh, that one? You've read it?

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.670
Yeah, it's a real tearjerker.

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:21.880
Didn't you start bawling when the lover died from an illness?

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:29.890
Just remembering it makes you cry, doesn't it?

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:30.690
I...

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:31.310
Hm?

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:36.190
I just started reading it.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.070
I-I'm sorry.

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:40.400
Oh?

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.910
You're doing your homework now?

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:46.530
Yeah, I didn't finish it yesterday.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:49.080
Wow, that's unusual.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.750
It's 'cause I was up late reading a book.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:52.750
Really?

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:53.420
Oh.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.670
That one's "u".

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.130
No, it's "a".

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:58.460
Huh?

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.340
Ah...

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.430
This one's "E", right?

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:07.140
Wrong again. That one's "A".

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:08.180
What?

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:09.810
"E"...

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:10.350
"A".

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.320
What's this?

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:20.860
Done yet?

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.610
A bit more... just a bit more...

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:24.990
Now see here...

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.030
This one's "3", right?

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:29.240
It's "E".

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.080
Oh.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.710
Then, this one is "<b>ム", right?</b>

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:33.920
It's a "7".

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:34.670
Oh...

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.920
You're looking at it upside-down.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:42.010
Run-chan!

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:43.880
So you finished your homework.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.220
No, I didn't.

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:47.760
I finished it during break, like usual.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:50.010
<i>Run's talking with a guy.</i>

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:52.430
<i>Oh, will Tooru be angry again?</i>

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:56.190
<i>Won't Tooru be coming soon?</i>

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:59.360
<i>Should I intercept Tooru and stall for time?</i>

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.440
<i>Or should I break them up when she comes?</i>

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:06.990
Hm?

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.830
What's wrong, Yuuko?

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.410
<i>R-Run is still...</i>

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:17.080
H-Hey, Tooru.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:18.580
What?

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.750
You see, right now, it's kind of...

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:23.800
Let me in.

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:27.220
Don't do it!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:31.180
You can't go in right now! You can't!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.890
Tooru, you were here?

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.900
<i>The coast is clear.</i>

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.400
It's okay now, Tooru.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.780
What? Huh? Tooru?

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.780
To the third-years,

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:49.740
please take good care of your health.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.790
First and second-years, be ready to advance a grade.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:54.790
Is everyone clear?

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:58.330
If you slack off third semester, it will be over before you know it.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:02.090
Keep your acts together and don't lose focus.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.050
Hey, you over there.

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:10.390
Who, me?

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.100
Yeah, you.

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.140
Can you do me a favor?

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.890
Pass these out to the class, please.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:18.520
Certainly.

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.400
But first, a question.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:22.150
Go for it.

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:25.150
What is my name?

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.780
Sensei, don't tell me...

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.000
You are our homeroom teacher.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.790
I'm so sorry.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:41.290
When you grow up, your memory just goes like <i>that. Quite tragic.</i>

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:43.710
Kamate-sensei!

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:45.460
How can you call yourself a teacher?!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:47.340
Kitou-sensei!

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:48.970
Huh? What's that mean?

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:51.890
How could you possibly forget a student's name?

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:57.520
I have the entire student body's names, faces, years, and classes perfectly memorized.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:58.980
Ooh, that's really something.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.350
For an educator, such things should be natural!

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:06.030
You never know when one of your dear students will come to you with a troubled heart.

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:08.990
When that happens, no matter who it is-

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:10.610
Hm?

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.990
It's your fault she got away.

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:15.870
So, you take these instead.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:16.580
Oh!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.290
Also, treat me to dinner after school!

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:19.080
What?!

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.710
Yutaka finally finished her homework thanks to you, Toorun.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:25.840
Huh?

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.840
We weren't checking answers?

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:28.970
Eheheh...

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:31.380
What's more, you didn't do any of it, did you?

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.180
Whoa! Correct!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.640
How did you know?

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:35.890
Now see here...

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.640
You'll be a second-year soon.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.770
Get your act together.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:43.100
What nice weather we have today.

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.610
Don't change the subject.

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:45.400
Oh.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:46.320
Hm?

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:47.150
Huh?

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:51.490
There's a kitten up there.

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:53.360
Is it stuck?

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:59.370
This cannot be ignored! Time to help!

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:00.790
Yutaka?

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.960
Get down! That's dangerous!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.170
Not to worry!

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:10.340
Despite how she looks, Yutaka is good at climbing trees!

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:16.550
Just wait right there. I'm coming for you.

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:19.810
Stay still, now...

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:26.190
Got you...!

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.160
U-Um...

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:37.950
<i>They're both angry!</i>

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.830
I'm so sorry!

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.870
I-I'll clean up the leaves!

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:43.330
That's not the issue.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:44.620
Huh?

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:47.920
What would you have done if you fell?

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.880
She's right! You were about to get hurt!

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:51.460
Yeah.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.050
Toorun...

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:55.550
Miporin...

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:59.760
What are you so happy about?

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:01.350
But, still,

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.100
a job well done.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:06.230
Yutaka did good, didn't she?

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:13.320
Thank goodness the kitty's all right, too.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.860
Cut that out, hey!

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:19.700
Stop licking me so much!

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.500
Quit flirting and clean!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:27.710
Tooru!

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.090
There you are.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:30.710
Run-chan!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.870
Will you be much longer?

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:35.550
Are things done on your end?

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:36.840
Yep, all done.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:39.300
Oh?

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:39.600
Huh?

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:46.890
Look! Your head's covered in leaf bits.

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:51.320
I'll get them for you.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.860
I-It's fine, you don't have to.

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:55.950
I'll get them myself.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:58.240
Oh, don't be shy.

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:00.830
Staaare...

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.250
There, all clean!

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:13.170
Th... Thanks.

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.760
What is it, Tooru?

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.010
N-Nothing.

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:21.350
S-So cute...

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:35.650
Is something the matter, Tooru?

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:40.450
If you don't eat quickly, it'll get cold.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:41.320
'Kay.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:50.170
This Durian Burger is delicious!

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.250
Mm, better than I expected.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:52.920
Hm?

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:56.380
Tooru, you've got some ketchup on you.

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:57.550
Right next to your mouth.

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:00.680
You're right.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.430
Thanks.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:02.930
Eh?

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.260
Run-chan, you've got some on you, too.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:06.270
Right here.

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:09.810
I bit my tongue...

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:12.690
Is that blood or ketchup?!

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:14.940
Run, Tooru!

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:16.860
Thanks for waiting.

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:18.610
Sorry we're late.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:22.490
A foreigner asked us for directions just now.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:24.780
We barely managed to help him...

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:25.950
Heahy?

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:28.750
A hohehah huh!

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.460
Ah oheh hoohey hah. He hoh hi.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:32.460
<i>Huh?</i>

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:34.920
<i>What language is that?</i>

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.590
<i>Is she testing me?</i>

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.550
She just bit her tongue.

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:41.050
Look!

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.970
I'm collecting points right now.

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:46.180
I want one of the prizes this place is offering.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.470
Oh, those things.

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:51.060
So, if you guys don't want yours,

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:53.020
I'd appreciate the help.

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:54.650
Here you go.

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:56.860
Thank you, Tooru.

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:58.690
Uh cah hah haih hoo.

00:11:58.690 --> 00:11:59.860
Thank you too, Run.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:02.910
I'm not collecting them, so I'll help you out.

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:05.030
Really? I'm so happy!

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:07.160
So, which prize do you want?

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.450
Mm, the stuffed bear key chain.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:11.620
It's really cute.

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:12.580
Really?

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:13.870
Heh hoo hee, heah hah,

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:17.880
huh hoo hi hah hohi hahah, ho hah, huhi haheh hoo!

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:21.300
Y-Yes, of course.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:21.920
Ah,

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:24.680
I'm going to go to the bathroom.

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:25.470
'Kay.

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:28.850
By the way, how many more points do you-

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:29.850
Wah!

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:30.390
Huh?

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:33.230
Ouch...

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:33.890
Huh?

00:12:37.870 --> 00:12:39.730
You're trying too hard with the pure white.

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:40.530
One point.

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:42.110
The lace is cute, though.

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:42.860
Two points.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:44.240
Hoheh hihuh hoo.

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:44.740
Hee hoih!

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:52.200
<i>That person threw out his points!</i>

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.880
<i>Oh, such a waste.</i>

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:01.300
<i>But it's already in the trash. I can't exactly fish it out.</i>

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:06.680
<i>I've got it! If I keep watch here, I might get points from people who are throwing them out!</i>

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:09.470
Yuuko's sure taking her time.

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:11.700
What's she doing?

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:12.770
Excuse me...

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:13.100
Huh?

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:16.690
I don't want my points, so if you like, you can have them.

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:17.560
Here.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:19.230
Hanh hoo!

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:21.070
Thank you very much!

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.440
Hou haih oh hah.

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:25.990
There might be lots of people who aren't collecting points.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:29.370
At this rate, we'll have enough for the prize in no time.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.740
Yuuko will be surprised when she gets back.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:32.580
Excuse me...

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.080
Are you collecting point cards?

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:36.420
Yes!

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:41.800
<i>Why?</i>

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:44.840
<i>Why is no one throwing out their point cards?</i>

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:47.980
Oh!

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:48.550
Hm?

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.930
"Limited time offer".

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:55.730
It's Durian Burger! It's a limited time offer!

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:57.690
Let's eat here!

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:58.900
Not today.

00:13:58.900 --> 00:13:59.690
Wha?

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:00.650
Why?

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:05.490
Don't you have homework to do?

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:07.910
Limited time offer...

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:09.950
Here you go.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:10.870
Thanks!

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.040
Please come again!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.630
How'd it go?

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.000
I got it!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.760
That's great, Yuuko-chan!

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:28.050
Thanks.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:30.680
I was surprised you gathered them so quickly.

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:35.520
Ta-dah!

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:38.390
See? Isn't it cute?

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:41.650
You really do like cute things, Yuuko.

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:45.730
Of course. What's cute is cute.

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:47.110
Finished!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:47.900
Huh?

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:49.280
Look!

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:50.780
What is it?

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:52.620
A paper crane!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.370
Tiny, isn't it?

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:57.700
So small I can't even see.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:59.830
That's not nice, Nagi-chan.

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:01.830
Hand me a magnifying glass.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:04.020
I don't have one on me.

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:04.340
Huh?

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:06.590
What about the one on your face?

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.590
What the hell do you think glasses are?!

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.260
Here you go.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:13.010
Thanks!

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:15.810
And you still lent them to her.

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.180
I don't really mind.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:18.890
Ahem.

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:21.600
Run. Are you all right in the head?

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:23.980
A Nagi impression!

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:26.570
If you're not gonna use them, give them back!

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:28.820
I thought you needed a magnifying glass?

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:29.240
What?

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:32.070
Oh, fine then.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:35.240
Nagi-chan, you're shrinking!

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:37.370
So cool!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:39.120
So small...

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:41.540
Indeed. Your eyes, that is.

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:44.420
Besides, your impression.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.630
It was nothing like me.

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:48.880
Oh, really?

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.630
You seem sure of yourself, Nagi.

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:52.550
Ah, I'd like to see that!

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:53.180
What?

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:55.680
Try doing an impression!

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:59.020
I'd rather not when people are watching, but...

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:04.730
Nagi-chan, those magnifying glasses look good on you!

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:06.360
Er...

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:09.070
Watch, damn it!

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:09.900
Huh?

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.700
You said you didn't want people to watch...

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:13.950
That's not how I meant it!

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.320
Then do it again!

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.200
I want to see it again, too!

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.120
N-No way!

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:22.080
Come on, we'll watch you this time!

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.000
I don't care!

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.370
Come on...

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:25.040
Hmph!

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:27.840
Nagi-chan's mad!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:30.460
We're sorry. But your impression was pretty good!

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:32.800
Yep! Just like me!

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:34.760
You weren't even watching!

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.140
How about here?

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:43.480
They have a limited time offer on the Durian Burger, see?

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:48.360
Nah, no way. It's probably full of students.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:51.360
Yeah, with the limited time offer and all.

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:53.950
This won't do!

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:57.240
Stopping for food on the way home is the first step towards delinquency!

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:58.870
We must intervene!

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:01.040
Oh, calm down.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:01.950
But...

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:03.730
You heard her. Go find another place.

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:06.540
Yes, yes, Miss Slave-driver.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:09.250
Hang on! I'm not done talking-

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:13.590
On that note, I'd prefer a fancier, more adult restaurant.

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:13.880
Wha-

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:18.470
Are you sure? How wonderful. We're being treated, no?

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:19.560
Yep. By Kitou.

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:20.680
Hey!

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:24.850
We're splitting the bill!

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:29.730
And anyway, that diet plan was completely useless.

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:30.520
Really?

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:32.530
Really? I thought it'd work.

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:37.490
Right? That's why I was surprised. I switched to a different plan.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:38.740
I see.

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:40.160
Is it all right for you to eat fries?

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:44.500
It's fine for today. I'm counting the calories and all.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:45.540
You sure?

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:49.420
Tooru?

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:51.750
Are you sleepy?

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:53.670
I'm fine...

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:56.260
It's already this late?

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:57.550
We must have chatted too long.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.640
Shall we head home?

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:00.550
Good idea.

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:03.430
Yep! Let's go, let's go!

00:18:05.490 --> 00:18:06.690
Back to space!

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:09.060
There she goes again...

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:10.150
I'm actually...

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:13.570
an alien!

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:18.410
<i>And Nagi's gonna retort...</i>

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:19.740
I knew it!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:22.660
I'd always suspected that!

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:24.040
It makes so much sense!

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:24.490
<i>What?</i>

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.120
You wouldn't put on any weight, no matter how much you ate...

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:29.000
You'd fly around sometimes, too!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.000
Run-chan?

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:51.190
See you, Run!

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:52.520
Take care!

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:53.770
Right!

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:57.860
See you, everyone!

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:59.450
Run-chan! Wait!

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:00.700
Yeah!

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:07.200
Earth had nice food. It was good!

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:09.160
What do you eat in space?

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.710
Space food!

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.290
Really?

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:19.130
Run-chan!

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.760
Oh, you're awake?

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:21.300
Huh?

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:23.800
You were fast asleep.

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:28.590
<i>A dream?</i>

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:31.350
Okay! Last stop, Tooru's place!

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.610
Sorry. Thanks.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:37.570
It's okay.

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:39.860
Well, I'm going home.

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:43.530
Not to space, right?

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:46.330
Tooru, telling a joke? That's unusual.

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:55.720
Good-bye!

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:57.300
Yeah!

00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:59.400
Bye-bye!

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:05.600
<i>Is everyone going to just graduate like that?</i>

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:12.600
Going somewhere?

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:14.710
The convenience store.

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:17.020
It's nighttime, so be careful.

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:17.610
Got it.

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:26.460
<i>No point in getting depressed.</i>

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:28.620
<i>I'll get something sweet and cheer myself up.</i>

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.380
Run-chan...

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:41.380
Oh!

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.220
Tooru!

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:54.850
Run-chan...

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:57.560
Hm? What is it, Tooru?

00:20:58.400 --> 00:20:59.650
Run-chan,

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:02.400
you never change, do you?

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:05.910
Nope!

00:23:19.760 --> 00:23:20.790
Tooru!

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:23.380
You're late!

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:25.630
I was getting tired of waiting.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:27.760
Let's hurry up and go home.

00:23:28.630 --> 00:23:29.380
Okay.

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:31.720
Here I go!
